{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-4a7b-8c9d-0e1f2a3b4c5d",
    "name": "StrangerX Backend API",
    "description": "Complete API collection for the StrangerX backend (Go + Gin).\n\n## Base URL\n- Local: `http://localhost:8080`\n- Set the `baseUrl` collection/environment variable accordingly.\n\n## Authentication\nProtected endpoints accept **either** of:\n- `Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}` — for Google-signed-in users (JWT issued by `POST /api/auth/google`).\n- `X-Guest-Token: {{guestToken}}` — for anonymous guests (UUID issued by `POST /api/guest/session`).\n\nRun **Auth → Google Sign In** or **Auth → Create Guest Session** first; their test scripts auto-store `jwtToken` / `guestToken` into collection variables.\n\nNote: `GET /api/me`, `PATCH /api/me/username`, `POST /api/me/username/confirm`, `POST /api/me/terms/accept` and `DELETE /api/me` are for **registered (JWT) users only** — guests receive `400`/`403`.\n\n## Realtime\nChat and presence use WebSockets (`/ws`, `/ws/presence`). See the **Realtime (WebSocket)** folder for the message protocols.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "wsBaseUrl", "value": "ws://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "jwtToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "guestToken", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "System",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Liveness probe. Returns `200` with a status payload when the server is up."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["health"] }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"ok\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Online Users Count",
          "request": {
